### Physics and naturalness after L01

- **Anatomy:** right elbow **49.34–105.51°** and total wrist bend **4.88–26.36°**, including quarter frames, retain their pre-fix ranges. The clearance pass increases shoulder elevation from **78.30° maximum to 97.35°**, within the screening range; imported wrist/shoulder axes remain anatomical proxies. Integer-frame left elbow 33.23–104.77°, left wrist 18.82–19.24°, knees L30.84–77.72°/R34.28–71.90°. Maximum segment-length error **0.0062 mm**. Original flight-reach and wrist-support fixes remain intact.
